# Development Guidelines
## System information
OS: macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 (25F84) arm64
Host: MacBook Pro (16-inch, 2021)
Kernel: Darwin 25.5.0
Packages: brew
Shell: zsh
WM: Quartz Compositor 1.600.0 (with Rectangle 0.93)
WM Theme: Multicolor (Dark)
Terminal: iTerm
CPU: Apple M1 Max (8+2) @ 3.23 GHz
GPU: Apple M1 Max (32) @ 1.30 GHz [Integrated]
Memory: 32.00 GiB

## Setup
### IDE
- IntelliJ IDEA

### Terminal
- iTerm2

## Behavior
### General
- Never make any unprompted formatting changes to task-unrelated code.
- After a change in code, at the end of the message, mention:
    - "Changed files:" to list files that were created, updated or deleted
    - "Next steps:" to take (i.e. commands to execute) briefly

### Languages
- Answer in the main language of the user prompt (English or German).
- Nutze die Vokale "ä", "ö" und "ü" für Deutsch.

### Markdown files
- When creating or editing markdown (.md) files, never insert a newline after a headline.
- Indent with 4 spaces ("    ")
